        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Boy Hits Car, The Invisible\n- Products: All That Led Us Here, The Invisible, My Animal\n- Events: European tour, Mercury Prize\n\nFacts:\n- The Invisible released their self-titled debut album The Invisible on 9 March 2009.\n- The Invisible's album The Invisible was nominated for the Mercury Prize and was selected as iTunes critics' choice album of the year.\n- Boy Hits Car's debut album My Animal was released in 1998.\n- Boy Hits Car released their fifth studio album All That Led Us Here in May 2014.\n- Boy Hits Car followed the release of All That Led Us Here with a European tour.",
